# Without this, line endings depend on whoever checked the repository out.
# core.autocrlf on Windows rewrites the working tree to CRLF, which makes
# `npm run sync:check` fail on a byte comparison against a header this repo
# generates with LF -- a drift report for a file that has not drifted.
# Pinning the working tree to LF everywhere keeps that check meaningful.
* text=auto eol=lf
